gajV(){return"Come in, boss, have a seat. How can I help you today?"},
gajh(){return"Mr. President, we need to have a talk about the transfer budget."},
gajj(){return"Mr. President, we need to put the stadium issue on the agenda right away."},
gajk(){return"Mr. President, there is an important matter regarding the training facilities."},
gajl(){return"Mr. President, I would like to discuss an investment plan for the club academy."},
gaji(){return"Mr. President, if you have a moment, I would like to talk about my own contract."},
gajc(){return"Let's talk transfer budget"},
gaje(){return"We should expand the stadium"},
gajf(){return"Let's upgrade the training facility"},
gajg(){return"The academy needs investment"},
gajd(){return"I want to discuss my contract"},
gajB(){return"Your current squad does not look bad at all, boss. Why do you need an extra transfer budget, could you explain?"},
gajD(){return"Taking on a stadium project is a huge investment. What is the rationale for this move, and why right now?"},
gajE(){return"I think our facilities are perfectly adequate. Can you tell me precisely what you find lacking?"},
gajF(){return"The academy is a long-term business, as you know. What makes it a priority now, why should we move it up?"},
gajC(){return"Contracts are a delicate subject, boss. What exactly are you expecting to change?"},
gajm(){return"We need a little more room to manoeuvre if we are to be effective in the transfer market, Mr. President."},
gajn(){return"There are gaps in our squad and we need to close them mid-season."},
gajo(){return"Our rivals are not standing still, so we have to move too. We do not want to fall behind."},
gajs(){return"Our capacity will fall short in the long run, so we should be planning for it now."},
gajt(){return"A modern stadium means both prestige and revenue. An investment in the future."},
gaju(){return"If we want to be a big club, our infrastructure has to be big as well."},
gajv(){return"The current facilities are inadequate; our players are not getting what they deserve."},
gajw(){return"The equipment is behind the times. Modern gear is essential for performance."},
gajx(){return"The training environment matters enormously for player psychology; we must invest."},
gajy(){return"Our academy facilities are more than ten years old; neither the bed capacity nor the pitch quality meets today's standards."},
gajz(){return"For three seasons we have promoted zero players from the U19s to the first team; if that trend continues our transfer costs will multiply."},
gajA(){return"Producing our own talent is strategically important in the long run, both for financial sustainability and for the club's identity, Mr. President."},
gajp(){return"There is a season and a half left on my current contract; I need longer-term security so that I can plan ahead."},
gajq(){return"Given last season's success and the responsibility we shouldered, I believe I deserve an adjustment on the salary side too."},
gajr(){return"I also expect clarity on authority: the final word on transfers being mine, and less interference from the sporting director."},
gajQ(){return"I understand, boss, and I accept the situation. Our coffers are a little tight, but I will speak to the board and come back to you with a concrete figure within a few days."},
gajS(){return"You have fair points, and this is a club-wide matter. I will call an extraordinary board meeting on architectural feasibility and financing options, and get back to you as soon as I can."},
gajT(){return"What you say makes sense, and I have been getting similar signals in recent months. Let us review the budget and sit down together over the facility plan."},
gajU(){return"Thinking long term is difficult, admittedly, but necessary. Let us hold a separate meeting next week with the academy director and yourself."},
gajR(){return"You know that we want to work with you for many years. I will have our lawyers prepare a draft and we can meet again next week."},
gajG(){return"This signing is critical for me."},
gajH(){return"Thank you, Mr. President, I will be worthy of your trust."},
gajK(){return"This step is essential for our club's future."},
gajL(){return"Thank you for your understanding, Mr. President."},
gajM(){return"The results on the pitch will be worth this investment."},
gajN(){return"Thank you, Mr. President, I have gone up in your estimation."},
gajO(){return"This is the club's ten-year project."},
gajP(){return"I am grateful for this vision, Mr. President."},
gajI(){return"I want to stay at this club for a long time."},
gajJ(){return"I will be worthy of your trust, thank you."},
